    "title": "Aiden Williams Back in the NFL as a Member of the Panthers' Practice Squad - Fox21Online",
    "text": "Aiden Williams Back in the NFL as a Member of the Panthers’ Practice Squad\nThe Alaska native previously spent time with the Steelers in training camp and also was on their practice squad for a brief period.\nDULUTH, Minn.- Former UMD offensive lineman Aiden Williams is back on a NFL Roster.\nOn Wednesday, the Carolina Panthers signed Williams to their practice squad.\nThe Alaska native previously spent time with the Steelers in training camp and also was on their practice squad for a brief period.\nSince he was released by Pittsburgh on September 3rd, Williams had a flurry of tryouts.\nThe Patriots, Saints, Browns, and Titans all worked out the tackle in recent weeks.",
